---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site.js';
---

<Base title="about" breadcrumb="~/about">
  <h1>about</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      i'm moe p. wellington, a 31-year-old artist from germany. i've been
      working with AI since 2022.
    </p>
    <p>
      my recent work explores the paradox between UI and AI: interfaces are
      systems designed to be read and understood by humans, while AI models
      reconstruct their visual language without understanding the logic,
      intention, or conventions those interfaces were built to communicate.
    </p>
    <p>
      what emerges is a kind of false memory of software. worlds that appear
      functional and navigable, but refuse to fully explain themselves. this
      recalls the sensation of encountering videogames as a child, before
      their symbols had settled into meaning: when something could feel
      familiar and operational long before i understood how to read it.
    </p>
    <p>
      AI allows me to return to that same condition: a system that seems to
      work, but begins to fall apart the closer you look. information before
      literacy. systems before understanding.
    </p>

    <h2>contact</h2>
    <p>no contact form here. find me on:</p>
    <ul>
      {SITE.socials.map((s) => (
        <li><a href={s.href} rel="me noopener">{s.label}</a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
